<title>PHILIPPINES: Manila Jockey Q3 net at 1.82 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Manila Jockey Q3 net at 1.82 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Manila Jockey Club Inc said on Wednesday it posted 1.821 million pesos in profits for the third quarter of the year.</p>
<p>The racetrack operator said in a statement it generated 44.184 million pesos in gross income from July to September. Total expenses amounted to 42.36 million pesos.</p>
<p>No comparative figures were provided.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418939 fax 8176267</p>
</text>
